			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nihil aliud curant, nisi agros, nisi villulas,
					nisi nummulos suos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 13, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
